<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Script</title>
    <style>
        body{
            max-width: 600px;
            padding: 3rem;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <p>Agent: “Thank you for joining our project. Before you go do you want you automated text alerts about your reminders and activity. We would send up to two messages per month. Message and data rates may apply depending on your mobile phone service plan. At any time you can get more help by replying HELP, or opt out completely by replying STOP. Our Terms of Service are available at webuyattention.com/terms and our Privacy Policy at webuyattention.com/privacy. Would you like to receive these text alerts — yes or no?”</p>
    <p>Customer: “Yes”</p>
    <p>Agent: “Great! We will send you a text message to confirm your enrollment.”</p>
</body>
</html>